<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Indicate by check mark whether the registrant has filed a report on and attestation to its management&#x2019;s assessment of the effectiveness of its internal control over financial reporting under Section 404(b) of the Sarbanes-Oxley Act (15 U.S.C. 7262(b)) by the registered public accounting firm that prepared or issued its audit report. <ix:nonNumeric name="dei:IcfrAuditorAttestationFlag" format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox" contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31">&#x2610;</ix:nonNumeric></p>
