     <td style="width: 96%;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Granted U.S. patent relating to methods of cloning a non-human mammal using transgenic ungulate embryos of one or more cells that have a human chromosome fragment and transgenic ungulate embryos of one or more cells that have a human chromosome fragment, and methods for making them (expiring in 2023 and 2025).</p> </td>
    </tr>

   </tbody>
  </table>
