     <td style="width: 2%;">&#xa0;</td>
     <td style="width: 2%;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#x25cf;</p> </td>
     <td style="width: 96%;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Granted patents U.S., Europe, Japan, and other major markets relating to large-scale production of human IgGs by transgenic animals with high production of fully human hIgG of at least 1 g/L in sera (expiring in 2030 and in the U.S., 2031).</p> </td>
    </tr>

