     <td style="width: 96%;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">A granted U.S. patent relating to reprogramming a call to express a T-cell receptor reactive with an antigen of interest (expiring in 2025).</p> </td>
    </tr>

   </tbody>
  </table>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&#xa0;</p>
