     <td style="width: 2%;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#x25cf;</p> </td>
     <td style="width: 96%;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">A granted U.S. patent and a pending U.S. application relating to methods for producing human IgGs against a pathogen comprising injecting a non-human animal with a viral pathogen-derived DNA vaccine in at least two locations of the animal (expiring in 2036).</p> </td>
