  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">General and administrative expenses decreased&#xa0;by $0.7&#xa0;million, or (4.1)%, in 2022, primarily due to decreased&#xa0;administrative salaries and benefits (year-over-year decrease of $2.3&#xa0;million), decreases in business, regulatory and marketing&#xa0;consulting (year-over-year decrease of $0.7&#xa0;million), offset by an increase in insurance costs (year-over-year increase of $2.0&#xa0;million), and public reporting&#xa0;expenses (year-over-year increase of $0.3&#xa0;million).</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
