  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Interest expense remained largely unchanged in 2022, driven by adding no new Finance&#xa0;Leases or other interest-bearing debt. We expect interest expense to increase in future periods as the accrued interest payable under the 8% Unsecured Convertible Note is realized over a full year.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
