     <td style="width: auto; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The shares subject to this stock option award will vest as to 25% of the shares on one-year anniversary of the grant date, and vest as to the remainder of the shares in 36 equal monthly installments thereafter.</td>
