  </div>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><a id="bs" title="bs" href="#"></a>SAB Biotherapeutics, Inc. and Subsidiaries </b></p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Consolidated Balance Sheets</b></p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
  <div>
