</tbody></table>
   </ix:nonNumeric>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Operating lease expense was approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c96548561" contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31_IncomeStatementLocationAxis-ResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5">1.2</ix:nonFraction>&#xa0;million and $<ix:nonFraction id="c96548562" contextRef="d_2021-01-01_2021-12-31_IncomeStatementLocationAxis-ResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5">1.1</ix:nonFraction>&#xa0;million, respectively, for the years ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2022</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">2021</em>. Operating lease costs are included within research and development expenses on the consolidated statements of operations.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Finance lease costs for the years ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2022</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">2021</em> included approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c96548565" contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAmortization" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">122,000</ix:nonFraction>&#xa0;and $<ix:nonFraction id="c96548566" contextRef="d_2021-01-01_2021-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAmortization" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">165,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, in right-of-use asset amortization and approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c96548567" contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseInterestExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">284,000</ix:nonFraction>&#xa0;and $<ix:nonFraction id="c96548568" contextRef="d_2021-01-01_2021-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseInterestExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">296,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, of interest expense. Finance lease costs are included within research and development expenses on the consolidated statements of operations.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Cash payments under operating and finance leases were approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c96548569" contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5">1.2</ix:nonFraction>&#xa0;million and $<ix:nonFraction id="c96548570" contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="sabs:FinanceLeasePayments" scale="6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5">0.4</ix:nonFraction>&#xa0;million, respectively, for the year ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2022</em>. Cash payments under operating and finance leases were approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c96548571" contextRef="d_2021-01-01_2021-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5">1.1</ix:nonFraction>&#xa0;million and $<ix:nonFraction id="c96548572" contextRef="d_2021-01-01_2021-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="sabs:FinanceLeasePayments" scale="6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5">0.5</ix:nonFraction>&#xa0;million, respectively, for the year ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2021</em>.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
